    "preamble": "Amul Cooperative Milk Federation ... vs Union Territory Of J&K & Ors on 13 December, 2023 Author: Sanjay Dhar Bench: Sanjay Dhar 48 Supplementary matter High Court Of Jammu &Kashmir And Ladakh At Srinagar Wp(C) No. 3210/2023 Cm No. 7708/2023 Amul Cooperative Milk Federation Limited ..... Petitioner (s) Through: Mr. Mir Reyaz Ahmad , Adv . V/s Union Territory of J&K & Ors. ..... Respondent(s) Through: None. Coram: Hon'ble Mr. Justice Sanjay Dhar, Judge. Order",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the Appellate Authority under the Act has not been constituted in the Union Territory of Jammu and Kashmir which has compelled the petitioner to invoke the writ jurisdiction of this Court. He has further submitted that on one hand the Adjudicating Officer has concluded that the petitioner has not committed any offence under the Act but at the same time he has imposed fine upon the petitioner which cannot be justified in law.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the Appellate Authority under the Act has not been constituted in the Union Territory of Jammu and Kashmir which has compelled the petitioner to invoke the writ jurisdiction of this Court. He has further submitted that on one hand the Adjudicating Officer has concluded that the petitioner has not committed any offence under the Act but at the same time he has imposed fine upon the petitioner which cannot be justified in law.",
